<h2 class="section-header">Result:</h2>
<p>The program was implemented successfully to find the longest substring containing unique characters. It demonstrates nested iteration, string searching using <code>indexOf()</code>, substring tracking, and user input handling using the <code>Scanner</code> class.</p>

